## stb

Lagrange includes the following single-file libraries by Sean Barrett and contributors:

* stb_image (image decoding)
* stb_image_resize2 (image scaling)
${if:LAGRANGE_ENABLE_AUDIO}
* stb_vorbis (Ogg Vorbis audio decoding)
${endif}
${if:LAGRANGE_ENABLE_STB_TRUETYPE}
* stb_truetype (font rendering)
${endif}

They are available under the MIT license (or public domain).
=> https://github.com/nothings/stb  stb Git Repository

