${if:LAGRANGE_ENABLE_FONTCONFIG}
## Fontconfig

Fontconfig is used for locating system fonts. It is distributed under an MIT-style license.
=> https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/fontconfig/fontconfig/-/blob/main/COPYING  Fontconfig license

${endif}
${if:LAGRANGE_ENABLE_MPG123}
## mpg123

mpg123 is an MPEG audio player and decoder library. It is licensed under LGPL 2.1. Lagrange uses the libmpg123 decoder library when playing back MPEG audio.
=> https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.en.html GNU LGPL version 2.1
=> https://mpg123.org/ mpg123

${endif}
${if:LAGRANGE_ENABLE_OPUS}
## Opus

Lagrange uses the opusfile, libopus, and libogg libraries from the Xiph.Org Foundation for playing back Opus audio. They are under the BSD 3-clause license.
=> https://opus-codec.org/license/  Opus license
=> https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause  The 3-Clause BSD License

${endif}
${if:LAGRANGE_ENABLE_WEBP}
## libwebp

libwebp is used for decoding WebP images. It is under the BSD 3-clause license.
=> https://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libwebp/+/refs/heads/main/COPYING  libwebp license
=> https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause  The 3-Clause BSD License

${endif}
${if:LAGRANGE_ENABLE_JXL}
## libjxl

libjxl is the reference implementation of JPEG XL, used for decoding JPEG XL images. It is under the BSD 3-clause license. libjxl depends on Brotli (MIT license) and Highway (Apache License 2.0).
=> https://github.com/libjxl/libjxl/blob/main/LICENSE  libjxl license
=> https://github.com/google/brotli/blob/master/LICENSE  Brotli license
=> https://github.com/google/highway/blob/master/LICENSE  Highway license

${endif}
${if:LAGRANGE_ENABLE_SPARKLE}
## Sparkle

Sparkle is a software update framework for macOS. It is under the MIT license.
=> https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/blob/2.x/LICENSE  Sparkle license

${endif}
${if:LAGRANGE_ENABLE_WINSPARKLE}
## WinSparkle

WinSparkle is a software update library for Windows. It is under the MIT license.
=> https://github.com/vslavik/winsparkle/blob/master/COPYING  WinSparkle license

${endif}
