## Hyphenation patterns

The American English hyphenation patterns are from the hyph-utf8 package. They are Copyright (C) 1990, 2004, 2005 Gerard D.C. Kuiken, and include the original patterns by Frank M. Liang and Donald E. Knuth.

> Copying and distribution of this file, with or without modification, are permitted in any medium without royalty provided the copyright notice and this notice are preserved.

=> https://www.hyphenation.org/tex  hyph-utf8

## Root certificates

This application may include a bundled copy of the Mozilla root CA certificate store (cacert.pem). It is distributed under the MPL-2.0:

=> https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/MPL/2.0/  Mozilla Public License 2.0

